    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review access to dermal filler and fat dissolving treatment without prescription",
        "additional_details": "There are reports that some fat dissolving treatments are not effective and can have negative unintended effects. These products are being sold legally without the need for a prescription",
        "background": "We believe all dermal fillers and fat dissolving treatment, including those injected into the face like fillers, skin boosters and fat melting treatments, should only be available with a prescription.",
